            { title = 'What was fetched', note = '• 25 BG-Wiki CatsEyeXI pages, fetched 2026-10-28 through the MediaWiki API in a few bulk requests, 30 s apart (BG-Wiki robots.txt Crawl-Delay).\n• CatsEyeXI Systems (last edited 2025-04-12)\n• CatsEyeXI Content (last edited 2025-08-08)\n• CatsEyeXI Content/Accelerated (last edited 2025-10-30)\n• CatsEyeXI/New Player Guide (last edited 2026-09-08)\n• CatsEyeXI Content/EXP (last edited 2026-09-19)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Milestone Rewards (last edited 2026-09-15)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Login Campaigns (last edited 2025-05-18)\n• CatseyeXI Crafting Guide (last edited 2026-09-08)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Crafting Rewards (last edited 2026-08-11)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Synthesis (last edited 2026-07-13)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/HELM (last edited 2026-04-20)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Digging (last edited 2025-08-09)\n• CatseyeXI/Fishing Guide (last edited 2026-05-14)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Fishing (last edited 2026-07-20)\n• CatsEyeXI Content/Drops (last edited 2026-02-02)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Augments (last edited 2025-04-12)\n• CatsEyeXI Content/Missions (last edited 2026-10-01)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Quests (last edited 2026-10-18)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Loxley Quest System (LQS) (last edited 2025-04-11)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Novice Trials (last edited 2026-08-30)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Jobs (last edited 2026-09-25)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Trusts (last edited 2026-09-19)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Navigation (last edited 2026-09-07)\n• CatsEyeXI Systems/Mog Vault (last edited 2026-10-28)\n• CatsEyeXI Commands (last edited 2026-07-25)' },
            { title = 'Licence and attribution', note = '• BG-Wiki states that its content other than Square Enix material is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (page BGWiki:Copyrights).\n• These notes are adapted from CatsEyeXI pages written by BG-Wiki contributors and are shared under the same licence, non-commercially, with this attribution.\n• FINAL FANTASY XI (c) SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD.' },
            { title = 'Not covered', note = '• Not fetched: per-slot equipment lists, Crystal Warrior and Wings Era Warrior pages, endgame pages (Abyssea, Dynamis, Sky, Sea, Ventures, Domain Invasion, HNMs, ZNMs, Dragonslaying and others), the NPC directory, monster list and weaponskill tables.\n• catseyexi.com/wiki is an index that links to BG-Wiki; it was read once.  catseyexi.com /api/ is disallowed by its robots.txt and was not fetched.\n• Fetched but not used, because they only point to other pages: CatsEyeXI Systems/Claim Shield, CatsEyeXI Systems/Treasure Caskets, CatsEyeXI Systems/Custom Equipment.\n• Items and skill levelling for this server are in gear_guide.lua and skill_guides.lua, generated from the server\'s public code, not from the wiki.\n• Wiki pages can lag behind the live server; the server\'s patch notes win.' },
