    { name = 'Server and game modes', group = 'Server', desc = 'What CatsEyeXI changes from retail, and its three game modes (Accelerated, Crystal Warrior, Wings Era Warrior). Source: https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI_Systems, https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI_Content, https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI_Content/Accelerated, https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI/New_Player_Guide', steps = {
            { title = 'Systems: Overview', note = '• CatsEye is home to various custom systems. In addition, some systems found in retail FFXI may be changed on this server to varying degrees. These changes and additions are detailed below.\n• If a system is not listed here (or on other CatsEyeXI pages such as Content or NPCs) then assume it is the same as retail. Also, keep in mind with any link you click that if the URL or title of the wiki page does not say "CatsEyeXI" in it, then you are looking at retail info, which may or may not be accurate to this server.\n• Just getting started? Check out the New Player Guide (ACE) or New Player Guide (Crystal Warrior)!' },
            { title = 'Systems: Aeonic Weapon Skill', note = '• See dedicated CatsEyeXI Systems/Aeonic Weapon Skill page.' },
