            { title = 'Crafting Rewards: Caps', note = '• Various custom crafting rewards are available. Additionally:\n• Players may have one main craft (and Fishing) to level 110.\n• Players may level all other sub crafts to level 70.\n    ◦ [CW] Crystal Warriors can reach 110 in ALL crafts.' },
            { title = 'Crafting Rewards: 100 Skill Rewards', note = '• [ACE] Leveling a craft to 100 will grant ACE players with a fully upgraded Relic Weapon voucher to be redeemed at any "ending" relic NPC.\n    ◦ Speak with Momiji in Lower Jeuno (I-6). This will place a flag on your character and cannot be seen as an item or Key Item.\n    ◦ Then go to the blank target associated with the weapon to receive your reward. Reference the Relic Weapon page.\n• [ACE] [CW] [WEW] Leveling a craft to 100, purchasing the "Way of the " Guild Point Key Item, and trading the requested item will grant the player with a Kupo Shield.\n    ◦ Speak with Nudara in Bastok Markets (I-8).\n    ◦ You must trade the respective craft item to Nudara in order to receive the Kupo Shield.\n• Craft: Alchemy; Required Item: Cursed Mail or Saida Ring\n• Craft: Smithing; Required Item: Cursed Hauberk or Gorkhali Kukri\n• Craft: Bonecraft; Required Item: Cursed Harness or Hajduk Ring\n• Craft: Woodworking; Required Item: Cursed Togi or Vejovis Wand\n• Craft: Cooking; Required Item: Cursed Soup or Sprightly Soup\n• Craft: Goldsmithing; Required Item: Cursed Cuirass or Evader Earring\n• Craft: Clothcraft; Required Item: Cursed Dalmatica or Swith Cape\n• Craft: Leathercraft; Required Item: Dusk Jerkin or Urja Trousers' },
            { title = 'Synthesis: Movement Speed', note = '• Item: Strider Boots THF RNG Trotter Boots [Rare][Ex] THF RNG; Level: 20; Stats: DEF: 4 AGI +2 Movement speed +18%; Notes: Used in synthesis for: Areion Boots (Feet, Lv20, THF/RNG, DEF:4 AGI+3 Accuracy+2, Movement speed +19%) Areion Boots +1 (Feet, Lv20, THF/RNG, DEF:5 AGI+4 Accuracy+3, Movement speed +20%)\n• Item: Herald\'s Gaiters MNK WHM BLM SMN SCH GEO Crier\'s Gaiters [Rare][Ex] MNK WHM BLM SMN SCH GEO; Level: 70; Stats: DEF: 16 MP +12 Evasion +8 Movement speed +18%; Notes: Used in synthesis for: Harbinger\'s Gaiters (Feet, Lv70, MNK/WHM/BLM/SMN/SCH/GEO, DEF:17 MP+15 Evasion+9, Haste+2%, Movement speed +19%) Harbinger\'s Gaiters +1 (Feet, Lv70, MNK/WHM/BLM/SMN/SCH/GEO, DEF:18 MP+18 Evasion+10, Haste+3%, Movement speed +20%)\n• Item: Geomancy Sandals GEO; Level: 75; Stats: DEF: 12 MP+15 AGI+5 CHR+5 Movement speed +12%\n• Item: Crimson Cuisses RDM PLD DRK RNG DRG BLU COR RUN; Level: 73; Stats: DEF: 43 HP+25 MP+25 Fire+20 Thunder+20 Water+20 Dark+20 Movement speed +12%\n• Item: Blood Cuisses RDM PLD DRK RNG DRG BLU COR RUN; Level: 73; Stats: DEF: 44 HP+27 MP+27 Fire+21 Thunder+21 Water+21 Dark+21 Movement speed +18%\n• Item: Hermes\' Sandals WAR MNK COR PUP RUN; Level: 70; Stats: DEF:17 HP+12 Evasion+5 Enmity+3 Movement speed +18%\n• Item: Hermes\' Sandals +1 WAR MNK COR PUP RUN; Level: 70; Stats: DEF:18 HP+14 Evasion+6 Enmity+4 Movement speed +19%\n• Item: Skadi\'s Jambeaux THF BST RNG COR; Level: 75; Stats: DEF:16 STR+3 VIT+3 Accuracy+5 Ranged Accuracy+5 Evasion-5 Movement speed +19%' },
