            { title = 'Club', note = '• Blurred Rod (Club, Lv75, WAR/MNK/WHM/BLM/PLD/SMN/BLU/SCH/GEO, DMG:39 Delay:288, INT+7 MND+7 Accuracy+10) — on Synthesis\n• Blurred Rod +1 (Club, Lv75, WAR/MNK/WHM/BLM/PLD/SMN/BLU/SCH/GEO, DMG:40 Delay:280, INT+8 MND+8 Accuracy+12, Occasionally attacks twice) — on Synthesis\n• Dowser\'s Wand (Club, Lv40, GEO, DMG:15, Delay:216, INT+2 Magic Accuracy+2, Rare, Ex) — on Quests\n• Starfall (Club, Lv75, WHM/PLD/GEO, DMG:49 Delay:340, MP+25 STR+5 MND+5, Attack+10, (Hidden effect: Deals piercing damage)) — on Synthesis\n• Starfall +1 (Club, Lv75, WHM/PLD/GEO, DMG:50 Delay:334, MP+25 STR+6 MND+6, Attack+15, (Hidden effect: Deals piercing damage)) — on Synthesis' },
